body:
Mary- thanks for including me in this notice.  I would like to wish you the
very best in your new position and location.  Perhaps our paths will cross
again.  Of course, if I can ever be of assistance in any way, please let me
know.  Jim

-----Original Message-----
From: Mary.Hain@enron.com [mailto:Mary.Hain@enron.com]
Sent: None
